text: >
  Hikou: This Vehicle is capable of flight, by one means or another.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: The Pilot may use the Soar Maneuver while piloting this Vehicle. The current High Environment of the
  Vehicle is also applied to all Characters within the Vehicle.

